    "text": "Hi Nova, I've found some flights from SKA to SKE on 2026-12-07. There are two options:\n\n1. Flight SA257: Departing from SKA at 06:15, arriving at SKE at 08:20. The price for a Saver fare is $79.\n2. Flight SA258: Departing from SKA at 09:40, arriving at SKE at 10:35. The price for a Saver fare is $189.\n\nWhich one would you like to book?",
